Package: OlympicRshiny
Title: 'Shiny' Application for Olympic Data
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Amalan", "Mahendran", , "amalan0595@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: Provides a 'Shiny' application for exploring and visualizing
    Olympic Games data from 1896 onwards, including both Summer and Winter
    Olympic Games. The application provides interactive visualizations of
    athletes, countries, sports, events, and medal results. Olympic data
    are obtained from the 'olympicAthletes' R package.
